        "original_id": "ae14943e-5a21-52d3-99bc-90d8d7213319",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Basij, CNN, BBC, Fox News, Fox Entertainment Group, 21st Century Fox\n- People: Neda Agha-Soltan\n- Places: 1211 Avenue of the Americas, New York City, New York\n- Topics: Death of Neda Agha-Soltan, disputed responsibility, television news channels\n\nFacts:\n- In reports cited by CNN, BBC, and Fox News, Neda Agha-Soltan was shot by Basij, although the identity of her killer is disputed.\n- Fox News, officially the Fox News Channel and commonly abbreviated FNC, is an American basic cable and satellite television news channel.\n- Fox News is owned by the Fox Entertainment Group, which is a subsidiary of 21st Century Fox.\n- Fox News broadcasts primarily from studios at 1211 Avenue of the Americas in New York City, New York.",
